expansion that starts at r=0 and extends up to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["r", "i"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bb57bb88-aead-d840-b225-8eb429944240"],
 ".  This obtained value of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["r", "i"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "833926ce-cbab-a14b-9e05-d289bfb44989"],
 " is then used as the initial matching point for the numerical integration \
in the Star Profiles section, where the energy density profiles are computed \
and all the plots are shown. Finally, the last section, \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Results\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], displays the star \
profile where the power-law behavior can be observed; thus, this section can \
be run as a whole and then visualize the key findings in the last subsection."
}], "Text",
